    "reviews": "\u201cInspired by Japanese horror, Morph Girl is a very interesting indie FMV game. Hopefully, this short-and-sweet vignette is the first of more independent FMV games to come.\u201d<br>Eric Van Allen, Kotaku<br><br>\u201cIf you can say to yourself: &quot;What is the craziest f*cking thing that could possibly happen right now?&quot;, that sh*t happens in this game. It is BIZARRE.\u201d<br>Jesse Cox, The Co-Optional Podcast<br>",
